            :op1 (t / temporal-quantity
                :quant 8
                :unit (h2 / hour))
            :op2 (t2 / temporal-quantity
                :quant 14
                :unit (h / hour)))))

# ::tok At this stage , the cervix is gradually opened ( in order to allow the fetal passage at birth ) and at the end of the process should reach a diameter of about ten centimeters .
